meta {
  name: Submit ASH Online registration
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/forms/ash-online/registration
  body: multipartForm
  auth: inherit
}

body:multipart-form {
  childFirstName: John
  childSurname: Doe
  dob: 2010-05-15
  age: 14
  childClass: JSS2
  schoolName: Example School
  schoolLocation: Lagos
  childEmail: john.doe@example.com
  tutoringDays: MONDAY
  timeAvailability: Evening
  subjectsOfInterest: MATHEMATICS
  currentCurriculum: @file(C:\Users\Maxmillian\Pictures\mmlogo-light.jpeg) @contentType(image/jpeg)
  academicReport: @file(C:\Users\Maxmillian\Pictures\mmlogo-light.jpeg) @contentType(image/jpeg)
  prevTermClassAverage: 75%
  prevTermClassPosition: 5th
  parentName: Jane Doe
  parentPhone: 08012345678
  parentEmail: jane.doe@example.com
  parentalConsent: true
}

vars:pre-request {
  baseUrl: http://localhost:3000
}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Submit ASH Online Registration
  
  Registers a new student into the ASH Online programme. Accepts a multipart form that includes student details, academic information, subjects of interest, and required file uploads (current curriculum and academic report).
  
  On success, the student record is inserted into the database and cached. The endpoint returns the newly created registration object with a `201 Created` status.
  
  ## Authorization
  No authentication is required for this endpoint (public form submission).
  
  ## Request Body (`multipart/form-data`)
  
  ### Programme & Personal Details
  
  | Field           | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                 |
  |-----------------|--------|----------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | childFirstName  | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                               |
  | childSurname    | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                               |
  | dob             | date   | Yes      | ISO date string — e.g. `2010-05-15` should follow `YYYY-MM-DD` format                        |
  | age             | number | Yes      | Integer between `3` and `17` (inclusive)                                                     |
  | childClass      | string | Yes      | One of: `KG / NURSERY 1`, `KG / NURSERY 2`, `KG / NURSERY 3`, `PRIMARY 1` to `PRIMARY 6`, `JSS1` to `JSS3`, `SS1` to `SS3` |
  | schoolName      | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                               |
  | schoolLocation  | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                               |
  | childEmail      | string | Yes      | Valid email address                                                                          |
  | tutoringDays    | array  | Yes      | Array of strings, e.g. `MONDAY`, `TUESDAY`, `WEDNESDAY`, `THURSDAY`, `FRIDAY`, `SATURDAY`, `SUNDAY` |
  | timeAvailability| string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                               |
  | subjectsOfInterest| array | Yes      | Array of strings, e.g. `MATHEMATICS`, `ENGLISH`, `SCIENCE`, `PHYSICS`, `CHEMISTRY`, `BIOLOGY`, `LITERATURE IN ENGLISH`, `GOVERNMENT`, `FINANCIAL ACCOUNTING`, `COMMERCE`, `OTHER` |
  | prevTermClassAverage| string | Yes  | Non-empty text                                                                               |
  | prevTermClassPosition| string| Yes  | Non-empty text                                                                               |
  
  ### Parent Information
  
  | Field                | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                 |
  |----------------------|--------|----------|--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | parentName           | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                               |
  | parentPhone          | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                               |
  | parentEmail          | string | Yes      | Valid email address                                                                                          |
  | parentalConsent      | boolean| Yes      | Must be `true`. Defaults to `false`.                                                                         |
  
  ## File Uploads
  
  | Field             | MIME Types Accepted        | Required | Notes                                      |
  |-------------------|----------------------------|----------|--------------------------------------------|
  | currentCurriculum | PDF, image                 | No       | Uploaded to `/Cedarrise Initiative/ASH-ONLINE-ASSETS/CURRICULUMS` on Cloudinary |
  | academicReport    | PDF, image                 | No       | Uploaded to `/Cedarrise Initiative/ASH-ONLINE-ASSETS/REPORTS` on Cloudinary     |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`201 Created`** — Returns the newly created ASH Online registration record.
  
  ```json
  {
    "success": true,
    "message": "ASH Online registration form submitted successfully",
    "data": {
      "id": "uuid",
      "childFirstName": "john",
      "childSurname": "doe",
      "dob": "2010-05-15T00:00:00.000Z",
      "age": 14,
      "childClass": "JSS2",
      "schoolName": "example school",
      "schoolLocation": "lagos",
      "childEmail": "john.doe@example.com",
      "tutoringDays": ["MONDAY"],
      "timeAvailability": "evening",
      "subjectsOfInterest": ["MATHEMATICS"],
      "currentCurriculumUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/...",
      "currentCurriculumPublicId": "Cedarrise Initiative/ASH-ONLINE-ASSETS/CURRICULUMS/...",
      "academicReportUrl": "https://res.cloudinary.com/...",
      "academicReportPublicId": "Cedarrise Initiative/ASH-ONLINE-ASSETS/REPORTS/...",
      "prevTermClassAverage": "75%",
      "prevTermClassPosition": "5th",
      "parentName": "jane doe",
      "parentPhone": "08012345678",
      "parentEmail": "jane.doe@example.com",
      "parentalConsent": true,
      "status": "pending",
      "createdAt": "2026-08-27T00:00:00.000Z",
      "updatedAt": null,
      "deletedAt": null
    },
    "meta": {
      "correlationId": "uuid-v4-string"
    }
  }
  ```
  
  The created record cache for list is invalidated using the key `cedarrise:ashonline:registrations:*`.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status | Description                                                                 |
  |--------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`        | Validation failed — missing required fields or invalid enum values. |
  | `400 Bad Request`        | No files were attached to the request.                              |
  | `429 Too Many Requests`     | Rate limit exceeded (`formUploadLimiter`: 3 requests per 15-minute window, keyed by IP). |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Cloudinary upload failed. |
}
